  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Twinning proposal Croatia, Swedish Board of Fisheries, HR2005/IB/AG/01 &quot;Institutional Capacity Building and Support to the Directorate of Fisheries in Administering and Control of Common Fisheries Policy (CFP)&quot;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fiskeriverket har formulerat ett twinning-f&#xf6;rslag f&#xf6;r ett twinning-projekt i Kroatien. Projektet ing&#xe5;r i Phare 2005 och har beteckningen HR2005/IB/AG/01 &quot;Institutional Capacity Building and Support to the Directorate of Fisheries in Administering and Control of Common Fisheries Policy (CFP)&quot;. Fiskeriverket kommer att bilda konsortium och vara junior partner, med Nederl&#xe4;nderna som lead</narrative>
